<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5481/5491.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5481/5491.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5481/5491 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Monday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Tuesday will be 5486.</p>
<p>On Friday the bid/offer rates were 5479/5489, with the official dollar rate 5484 from Saturday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5383/5983 after 5380/5980.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
